<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 97,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 97,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 97,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50-$1.00 lower than mid-session Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    55.50 -56.50	   56.50 -57.50</p>
<p>few						   57.00  58.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 2.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs.  43.00 -46.00	   45.00 -47.00</p>
<p>	 500 lbs. up   46.00 -48.00	   47.00 -50.00</p>
